# D.Ai Server: the computers allowed to reach SSH (docs/SERVER.md §3). The install writes this file.
# Until it lists someone, SSH is unreachable on purpose: nobody gets in by default.
# One line per computer or network, for example:
#   add element inet dai_filter admin_ssh { 192.168.10.5, 192.168.20.0/24 }
